{
  "provenance": "Composed from the shapes DESIGN-2026-09-18-hook-rewrite-or-ask.md §1 names, one record per shape and per approved read, not transcribed from a transcript: the coordinator's 2026-09-18 replay was reported as counts (5 approved, 18 prompted with no reason, 1 denied) and the commands themselves were not recorded anywhere this build could read. See self/features/hook-rewrite-or-ask/NOTES.md, ruling 9.",
  "cwd": "the throwaway project root self/tests/allow-repo-commands.sh builds, so every path here is relative to it",
  "verdicts": {
    "ALLOW": "approved silently",
    "REWRITE": "denied with the rewrite as the reason (the seven opaque shapes included)",
    "DENY": "denied by one of the three older shape denies",
    "ASK": "read and not vouched for: the hook prints nothing and the human decides"
  },
  "records": [
